            "Play your way": [
              "World atlas with discovery and saved waypoints; rebindable controls.",
              "Slopwoofer Lullaby with independent music volume and frequency.",
              "Launcher discovers new versions automatically and keeps installed versions available offline."
            ],
            "Known limitations": [
              "Development snapshot; finite creature roster and Slopcraft circuit rules.",
              "Detailed blocks load within 2\u201312 chunks; distant landscapes reach 32 chunks.",
              "macOS is ad-hoc signed without notarization; Windows builds are unsigned."
            ]
